# Placeholder directory marker for the standard `image/` directory.
#
# gallate's `init` MAY create standard directories (text/, image/)
# as empty placeholders. They are populated when the CLI actually
# extracts or injects.

# An init command that creates this layout:
#
#   tool init ./my-game \
#     --input ./game.pfs \
#     --output ./game-zh.pfs \
#     --media text,image
#
# Note: NO audio/ video/ font/ scripts/ — those are
# engine-extension. They would only appear if the user (or engine)
# creates them.